Your comment is, overall, highly insightful, except for this
statement.

There have always been errors in Nethack's design.  Nurses used to
never disappear, no matter how many hit points they gave you.  You
used to be able to polypile without penalty.  You used to be able to
wish for means of wishing.

All of these things were removed from the game, for the same reason
I'm sure that pudding farming will be removed: because they destroyed
scarcity of one type or another.  Farming strategies became bad during
the lifetime of Nethack 3.4.3, which is still the current version of
the game.  All the billion-plus scores at alt.org are from 2005 or
later, 3.4.3 was released in December 2003.

